_acme-challenge.proxy.xmpp IN NS ns.kleen.org.
_acme-challenge.muc.xmpp IN NS ns.kleen.org.

auenheim 60 IN DS 3888 15 2 17B1819507B58001B09F5283A5356F151853E0A15AD611BC736EF54414462FFA
auenheim    IN NS boron.auenheim.kleen.org.

forstheim 60 IN DS 19933 15 2 A5C60B288DFED6B52278ADE641B1ACF458C1AC9320A2DF5C42293128D829CC3C
